snafun.Rproj

# knitr output from running knit() on a vignette from the project root, rather
# than letting R CMD build render it from vignettes/. The rendered .md lands in
# the root too, but it is not ignored here: a blanket /*.md rule would silently
# swallow a future NEWS.md or CONTRIBUTING.md. Leave it visible in git status,
# and let .Rbuildignore keep it out of the tarball.
/figure/
